templates/skills/to-spec/SKILL.md
templates/skills/to-tickets/SKILL.md

Adapted — not included verbatim — from Matt Pocock's `to-spec` and
`to-tickets` skills (upstream renames of `to-prd` and `to-issues`),
licensed under the MIT License by their original author.

Both were rewritten for this pipeline and differ from the originals in
substance, not only in wording: neither interviews the user or re-explores
the codebase, because an approved plan and a context sweep already exist by
the time they run; and `to-tickets` produces internal work-units approved
on a board rather than issues published to a tracker. Each file states its
own derivation in its opening lines.
